Z||000000||fierodave||01-02-2000||05:31 AM||||hello all!  <BR>Here is the friday night progress on the pace car i have,  <P>Thought a few of you may have never seen your fiero with the front end cut off :~)<BR>The core support was removed to do a better job,  beating the old one around would have took the same amount of time, and this way the job is done right!  took about 6 hours to complete this step! note old support on floor in front of car!  <P>Should be back on the road with a new coat of paint, refurbished rims, the decal kit, and a few other odds and ends.  thanks for the space  FD<BR> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=101570&a=1368386&p=14795702&Sequence=3" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=101570&a=1368386&p=14795702&Sequence=3</A>  <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=101570&a=1368386&p=14795602&Sequence=3" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=101570&a=1368386&p=14795602&Sequence=3</A>  <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=101570&a=1368386&p=14795629&Sequence=3" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=101570&a=1368386&p=14795629&Sequence=3</A>  <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=101570&a=1368386&p=14795644&Sequence=3" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=101570&a=1368386&p=14795644&Sequence=3</A> <p>[This message has been edited by fierodave (edited 01-02-2000).]||||reg||12
Z||000001||TOM||01-02-2000||09:53 PM||||Thats how I would have done it. A cut and weld is better than beating the old one out. But what do I know.||||reg||1
Z||000002||fierodave||01-02-2000||10:51 PM||||Tom i will tell you what!  we used a plasma cutter  omg  lol  what a blessing that tool is!  honest to god! once we were ready to do the cut out, it took 15 minutes to cut the spot welds  remove the core support and another 25 minutes to weld it in!!!!  the old way drilling them out would have taken three hours to remove it,  and another hour of welding up the big holes!  well i hopr the rest is as smooth as this !  the new spray booth won't hurt either!!!   the first car trough this one(booth) will be a fiero :~)<P>Still need them Indy parts!!!!  <BR>FD||||reg||1
Z||000003||TOM||01-03-2000||12:43 AM||||Yes a plasma cutter is the hot ticket. Like a hot knife through butter.||||reg||1
